      "description_en": "Proposal cover: using the brand's parallel sensory lines and open-node grammar, it places the AI-ON and AI-OFF service lines side by side as exact equivalents, with ten nodes standing for the ten independent-completion points and three coloured open nodes marking the three key areas. Labelled 概念建议 / CONCEPT on the image.",
