      "description_zh": "2 分 34 秒中文导览：城市智能的检验标准、AI 开启与关闭的服务等价、一条底线与三座实验院的空间骨架、三区两翼分工、十个独立完成点的评价意义，以及概念性质与边界声明。旁白由系统语音合成，无真人录音、无音乐、无实地录音。",
      "description_en": "A 2-minute-34-second Chinese guide covering the test of urban intelligence, service equivalence between AI ON and AI OFF, the spatial framework of one accessible spine and three sensory labs, the roles of the three areas and two wings, the evaluative purpose of the ten independent-completion points, and the conceptual scope and limits. Fully synthetic speech: no human recording, no music, no field audio.",
