      "title_en": "Every Sense Jing-Zhang multimodal short film (Chinese narration, bilingual on-screen labels)",
      "description_zh": "63 秒短片，七个镜头：片头主题、总体结构与三处重点区、骨架与等价服务网络、三处重点区的人尺度运行合同、第 16 章交互场景的逐帧实录、品牌语法与文化底线、片尾边界声明。交互段实录连续呈现「播放引导流光」与「切换 AI 关闭」两次真实操作，切换前后十个独立完成节点的位置与可达性、以及服务可达性读数 10 / 10、2、3 / 3 完全不变。中文合成旁白，画面关键标注中英双语，中文字幕既烧录在画面上也提供外挂 WebVTT。无真人录音、无音乐、无实拍、无第三方素材、无生成式影像。",
      "description_en": "A 63-second film in seven shots: title, overall structure and the three key areas, the framework and equivalent service network, the human-scale operating contracts of the three key areas, a frame-accurate capture of the chapter-16 interactive scene, the brand grammar and cultural baseline, and the closing scope statement. The captured sequence performs two real interactions — play the guidance flow, then switch to AI OFF — after which the ten independent-completion nodes and the service readout of 10 / 10, 2 and 3 / 3 remain unchanged. Synthetic Chinese narration, bilingual on-screen labels, Chinese captions both burnt in and supplied as WebVTT. No human recording, no music, no live-action footage, no third-party assets, no generative imagery.",
